# ---------- 91: AI ตรวจย้อนหลังข้อมูลขนาดยาที่อนุมัติแล้ว ----------
run("""insert into drug_fda_labels(key,generic,route,title,sections) values ('aud91|ORAL','aud91','ORAL','Aud91',
  '[{"title":"ขนาดยาและวิธีใช้","body":"Children: 10 to 15 mg/kg every 6 hours. Do not exceed 1000 mg per day."}]')""")
A91 = check("admin approves a drug (passes rules)", "admin", """insert into dose_drugs(name,indication,mg_per_kg_min,mg_per_kg_max,per,indications,concs,active) values ('ตรวจย้อนหลัง91','x',20,30,'dose','[{"name":"ไข้","per":"dose","min":20,"max":30,"cap":500,"age_min":0,"age_max":12}]','[]',true) returning id""", lambda o: o.strip().isdigit()).strip()
run(f"insert into local_drugs(name,category,fda_key,dose_id) values ('AUD91 250 MG/5 ML','ยาน้ำรับประทาน','aud91|ORAL',{A91})")
check("new approved drug has no audit flags", "anon", f"select audit_flags::text from dose_drugs where id={A91}", eq("[]"))
check("web cannot run audit tick", "admin", "select dose_audit_tick(false, true)", "deny")
def audit_answer(aid, ans):
    run(f"""insert into net._http_response(id,status_code,content) select request_id, 200, jsonb_build_object('candidates', jsonb_build_array(jsonb_build_object('content', jsonb_build_object('parts', jsonb_build_array(jsonb_build_object('text', $q${ans}$q$))))))::text from dose_audits where id={aid}""")
T1 = check("auto tick sends one approved drug with a label (forced = not waiting for night)", "service", "select dose_audit_tick(false, true)->>'sent'", lambda o: o.strip().isdigit()).strip()
check("next tick does not send another while one is pending", "service", "select dose_audit_tick(false, true)->>'sent'", lambda o: o.strip() == '')
audit_answer(T1, '{"items":[]}')
check("tick reads answer of pending audit → done (no flags when all ok)", "service", f"select dose_audit_tick(true, false); select status from dose_audits where id={T1}", lambda o: o.splitlines()[-1].strip() == 'done')
AU1 = check("admin asks AI audit of a drug now", "admin", f"select dose_audit_now({A91})", lambda o: o.strip().isdigit()).strip()
check("audit prompt has label text + indications + rules · key only in header · no MIMS", None, f"select (convert_from(q.body,'utf8') like '%10 to 15 mg/kg every 6 hours%' and convert_from(q.body,'utf8') like '%ไข้%' and convert_from(q.body,'utf8') like '%cap_day%' and q.headers->>'x-goog-api-key'='test-key-123' and convert_from(q.body,'utf8') not like '%test-key-123%')::text from dose_audits a join net.http_request_queue q on q.id=a.request_id where a.id={AU1}", eq("true"))
audit_answer(AU1, '{"items":[{"name":"ไข้","level":"wrong","why":"ฉลากให้ 10–15 มก./กก. ไม่ใช่ 20–30","quote":"10 to 15 mg/kg every 6 hours"},{"name":"ข้อที่ไม่มีจริง","level":"wrong","why":"x","quote":"10 to 15 mg/kg"}]}')
check("answer → 'wrong' flag (quote found in label) · unknown indication ignored", "service", f"select dose_audit_tick(true, false); select jsonb_array_length(audit_flags) || ':' || (audit_flags->0->>'level') from dose_drugs where id={A91}", lambda o: o.splitlines()[-1].strip() == '1:wrong')
check("public can read the flag (calculator hides that dose)", "anon", f"select audit_flags->0->>'level' from dose_drugs where id={A91}", eq("wrong"))
check("admin cannot clear/forge flags by direct update", "admin", f"update dose_drugs set audit_flags='[]' where id={A91} returning jsonb_array_length(audit_flags)", eq(1))
check("staff cannot resolve flags", "s2", f"select dose_audit_resolve({A91}, 'ไข้')", "deny")
check("staff cannot run audit now", "s2", f"select dose_audit_now({A91})", "deny")
check("admin resolves flag (checked: data correct)", "admin", f"select jsonb_array_length(dose_audit_resolve({A91}, 'ไข้'))", eq(0))
check("resolving is logged in drug history", None, f"select count(*) > 0 from drug_data_history where table_name='dose_drugs' and row_id={A91} and 'audit_flags' = any(fields)", eq("t"))
AU2 = check("admin asks AI audit now", "admin", f"select dose_audit_now({A91})", lambda o: o.strip().isdigit()).strip()
audit_answer(AU2, '{"items":[{"name":"ไข้","level":"wrong","why":"เดา","quote":"30 mg/kg every 4 hours"}]}')
check("'wrong' with quote not in label → downgraded to 'doubt' (shown + admin warning only)", "admin", f"select dose_audit_poll({AU2})->'flags'->0->>'level'", eq("doubt"))
AU3 = check("third audit", "admin", f"select dose_audit_now({A91})", lambda o: o.strip().isdigit()).strip()
audit_answer(AU3, '{"items":[{"name":"ไข้","level":"wrong","why":"x","quote":"10 to 15 mg/kg every 6 hours"}]}')
check("admin edits indications before answer arrives", "admin", f"""update dose_drugs set indications='[{{"name":"ไข้","per":"dose","min":10,"max":15,"cap":500,"age_min":0,"age_max":12}}]' where id={A91} returning (approved_at is not null)::text""", eq("true"))
check("stale answer (data changed since sent) → flags not applied · re-approval cleared old flags", "admin", f"select dose_audit_poll({AU3})->>'flags'", eq("[]"))
AU4 = check("fourth audit", "admin", f"select dose_audit_now({A91})", lambda o: o.strip().isdigit()).strip()
audit_answer(AU4, '{"items":[{"name":"ไข้","level":"doubt","why":"ฉลากไม่ระบุช่วงอายุ"}]}')
check("doubt flag set", "admin", f"select dose_audit_poll({AU4})->'flags'->0->>'level'", eq("doubt"))
check("admin edits + re-approves → flags cleared (pharmacist reviewed)", "admin", f"""update dose_drugs set indications='[{{"name":"ไข้","per":"dose","min":10,"max":15,"cap":400,"age_min":0,"age_max":12}}]' where id={A91} returning audit_flags::text""", eq("[]"))
check("web cannot read audits except admin", "s2", "select count(*) from dose_audits", eq(0))
check("admin cannot insert audits directly", "admin", "insert into dose_audits(dose_id) values (1)", "deny")
NOLAB = run("select id from dose_drugs where public.dose_audit_local(id) is null order by id limit 1")[1].strip()
check("drug without label cannot be audited (no MIMS sent)", "admin", f"select dose_audit_now({NOLAB})", "deny")
check("auto tick includes audit step", "service", "select (ai_auto_tick() ? 'audit')::text", eq("true"))
# ---------- 92: ธง 4 ประเภท + เภสัชกรตัดสิน (จำการตัดสิน · ไม่ธง/ซ่อนซ้ำทุก 30 วัน) ----------
AU5 = check("92: audit now", "admin", f"select dose_audit_now({A91})", lambda o: o.strip().isdigit()).strip()
check("92: prompt explains 'offlabel' (label has no such indication) ≠ 'wrong'", None, f"select convert_from(q.body,'utf8') like '%offlabel%' from net.http_request_queue q join dose_audits a on a.request_id=q.id where a.id={AU5}", eq("t"))
audit_answer(AU5, '{"items":[{"name":"ไข้","level":"offlabel","why":"ฉลากไม่มีข้อบ่งใช้นี้ในเด็ก"}]}')
check("92: 'offlabel' flag kept as its own level (+ sig of the indication)", "admin", f"select (dose_audit_poll({AU5})->'flags'->0->>'level') || ':' || ((dose_audit_poll({AU5})->'flags'->0) ? 'sig')::text", eq("offlabel:true"))
check("92: staff cannot decide", "s2", f"select dose_audit_decide({A91}, 'ไข้', 'local')", "deny")
check("92: anon cannot decide", "anon", f"select dose_audit_decide({A91}, 'ไข้', 'local')", "deny")
check("92: unknown decision rejected", "admin", f"select dose_audit_decide({A91}, 'ไข้', 'whatever')", "deny")
check("92: pharmacist decides 'offlabel_ok' → flag kept with decision + time", "admin", f"select (f->0->>'decision') || ':' || (f->0 ? 'decided_at')::text from (select dose_audit_decide({A91}, 'ไข้', 'offlabel_ok') f) t", eq("offlabel_ok:true"))
check("92: decision logged in drug history (who/when)", None, f"select count(*) from drug_data_history where table_name='dose_drugs' and row_id={A91} and changed_by is not null and new_values->'audit_flags'->0->>'decision' = 'offlabel_ok'", eq(1))
AU6 = check("92: re-audit (e.g. 30 days later)", "admin", f"select dose_audit_now({A91})", lambda o: o.strip().isdigit()).strip()
audit_answer(AU6, '{"items":[{"name":"ไข้","level":"wrong","why":"x","quote":"10 to 15 mg/kg every 6 hours"}]}')
check("92: same numbers → pharmacist decision kept (not flagged 'wrong' again)", "admin", f"select (dose_audit_poll({AU6})->'flags'->0->>'decision')", eq("offlabel_ok"))
check("92: undo decision → back to waiting", "admin", f"select (dose_audit_decide({A91}, 'ไข้', '')->0 ? 'decision')::text", eq("false"))
check("92: pharmacist confirms conflict", "admin", f"select dose_audit_decide({A91}, 'ไข้', 'conflict')->0->>'decision'", eq("conflict"))
check("92: changed numbers → old decision not reused", "admin", f"""update dose_drugs set indications='[{{"name":"ไข้","per":"dose","min":10,"max":15,"cap":450,"age_min":0,"age_max":12}}]' where id={A91} returning audit_flags::text""", eq("[]"))
check("cleanup audit test", "admin", f"delete from local_drugs where name='AUD91 250 MG/5 ML' returning id", rows(1))
check("cleanup audit dose", "admin", f"delete from dose_drugs where id={A91} returning id", rows(1))
run("delete from drug_fda_labels where key='aud91|ORAL'")

print(f"\n{passed} passed, {failed} failed")
sys.exit(1 if failed else 0)
